test.yaml:0:0: jobs.'job3'.uses '' has invalid reference format; expected owner/repo/path@ref [action]
test.yaml:4:42: jobs.'job1'.uses 'owner/repo/path/to/workflow.yml@v1' is not pinned to a full-length commit SHA. see https://github.com/owner/repo/tree/v1 (fixable with --fix --enable-pin-network) [action]
test.yaml:6:5: jobs.'job1' cannot have both uses and runs-on [syntax-check]
test.yaml:6:5: when jobs.'job1' calls reusable workflow with uses, key 'runs-on' is not allowed [workflow-call]
test.yaml:9:5: reusable workflow call "./.github/workflows/ci.yml@main" at "uses" is not following the format "owner/repo/path/to/workflow.yml@ref" nor "./path/to/workflow.yml". see https://docs.github.com/en/actions/learn-github-actions/reusing-workflows for more details [workflow-call]
test.yaml:9:37: jobs.'job2'.uses local reusable workflow reference must not contain '@ref' [action]
test.yaml:12:5: jobs.'job3' key 'with' requires uses [workflow-call]
test.yaml:19:5: jobs.'job4' references local reusable workflow './.github/workflows/not-existing.yml' but the file does not exist [workflow-call]
